# Build context filter for a root-context `docker build`, i.e. the local
# equivalent of what /.gcloudignore does for `gcloud builds submit`.
#
#   docker build -f deployments/pipeline_idx/Dockerfile .
#
# Cloud Build never reads this file and local docker never reads .gcloudignore,
# so the two have to be kept roughly in step by hand. Keep them that way: the
# point of a local build is that it reproduces the deployed one. If you exclude
# something here, ask whether .gcloudignore needs it too, and vice versa.

.git/
.github/

# Secrets. See the note in /.gcloudignore — load_dotenv(override=True) means a
# stray .env in the image would win over the secrets Cloud Run mounts.
.env
.env.*

.venv/
**/.venv/

# Not needed to build or run either job.
src/scripts/
nltk_data/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.DS_Store

# data/ is deliberately NOT excluded — see the matching note in /.gcloudignore.
